# #132 Dreadlord's hit-wake and Vampiric Pounce, native check by parity: a hit wakes a sleeper; the
# pounce's feint hops back with no grab; the bite heals him 4. Sleep's lengths are dreadlord.pad.
# Dreadlord a against Dreadlord b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero dreadlord
# a dashes in, inside Sleep's reach.
40 a stick 1 0
42 a stick 0 0
# Sleep on b; a's Carrion Swarm strikes the sleeper awake, and b attacks long before Sleep would end.
60 a stick 0 -1
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
130 a tap X 2
190 b tap A 2
# b's Carrion Swarm strikes a.
220 b tap X 2
# Vampiric Pounce feinted on its approach frame 5: a hop back, no grab.
280 a stick 1 0
280 a tap X 2
284 a tap X 2
285 a stick 0 0
# a dashes in twice as b walks toward him; Vampiric Pounce catches b and the bite heals a 4.
320 a stick 1 0
320 b press LB
320 b stick -1 0
322 a stick 0 0
340 a stick 1 0
340 b stick 0 0
340 b release LB
342 a stick 0 0
360 a stick 1 0
360 a tap X 2
361 a stick 0 0
#! expect a 60 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 110 damage 2.000
#! expect a 130 special 13 form 0
#! expect b 165 damage 9.000
#! expect b 190 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect a 257 damage 7.000
#! expect a 280 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 284 special-form 6 action 14
#! absent a 280-359 grab-hold
#! expect a 301 special 0 form 6
#! expect a 360 special 14 form 0
#! expect a 376 grab-hold start
#! expect a 392 grab-hold end
#! expect a 392 damage 3.000
#! expect b 392 damage 22.000
#! scene a SleepSpecialArt
#! scene a CarrionSwarmMissile
#! scene a DeathPactCaster
#! scene a BloodImpact
# View held a second, twice: the moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
